@lewis6991 expanding from my comment on your previous PR, I cross-checked our config with the current documentation, and this enables all optional rules that currently pass (on `master`) and disables only the non-passing, non-optional ones:
```json
  "diagnostics": {
    "disable": [
      "annotation-usage-error",
      "unnecessary-if"
    ],
    "enables": [
      "code-style-check",
      "missing-global-doc",
      "non-literal-expressions-in-assert",
      "unknown-doc-tag"
    ]
  },
```
This omits enabling `incomplete-signature-doc`, which currently does not pass. (Note that `code-style`and `incomplete-signature-doc` are disabled by default.)
